WEBVTT

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.620
The three separated at a fork in the road.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.180
And now their whereabouts are undisclosed, do they want to protect themselves or other people.

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.810
Or heavenly dreams?

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.770
The creases of disorder are a cauldron of three.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.430
To an endless, eternal picture of Hell,

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:19.520
pushing through time a door is dispelled.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.700
Your grudge shall be released.

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:44.850
I’m here!

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.820
Looks like you’ve submitted someone!

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:56.340
Take this!

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:07.500
The eyeball you licked…

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:14.920
Is on your brow… The eyeball is on your brow.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.940
My Teacher

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:49.960
Yuurisan-Subs & マイワイフ Subs

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:49.960
