00:02:55.210 --> 00:03:00.010
and the listed sponsors.

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:16.690
Whoa! D-Class is awesome!

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:18.460
Maybe our class’s resistance is crushed.

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:21.530
Maybe really crushed.

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:25.030
Follow the rhythm! Gracefully!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.580
Ichimoku Ren got cursed?

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:38.660
Serizawa Yuuna from 3-D submitted him.

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:45.340
It’s OK, Ojou rejected it as an error.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:46.640
Just…

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:53.580
Hah! You got cursed! You got cursed!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:54.860
Be quiet!

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:59.150
Ichimoku Ren, what’d you do?

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:01.120
Nothing.

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:02.900
Nothing?

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.800
If you’re going to say something,

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:08.180
maybe these good looks are at fault?

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.870
I’m totally at a loss!

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.260
I don’t remember Serizawa,

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:18.850
but she’s probably one of my shy fans!

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:20.170
Huh?

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:22.590
A hopeless crush turned into hate…

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:25.100
I’m such a sin-inducing guy!

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:28.890
Is he glad?

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:34.390
What a joyful guy.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:38.320
Let’s ferry him once.

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:40.910
Turn! Turn! Then, toss!

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:56.580
OK! That’s it for today.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:59.840
The recital’s soon, so work hard!

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:03.840
Yes! Thank you very much!

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:08.850
Here, you dropped this.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:14.410
Serizawa-san, maybe PE’s not your best subject.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.710
I’m sorry! I’ll be careful next time!

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:25.750
She looks like she wouldn’t hurt a fly!Today’s girls are scary.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:27.370
Oops, didn’t mean that.

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:28.780
Sone-sensei!

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:29.260
Oh?

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:34.150
You must be tired! Here!

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:37.160
Thanks! I’m in your debt every time!

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:41.040
Not at all, since I’m your fan.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:42.240
What’s that?

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:46.660
I was cooking, and I…

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:50.170
That bandage is so cute!

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:50.760
Really?

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:53.690
She’s here, that sycophant.

00:05:53.690 --> 00:05:55.430
Morohoshi-san from D-class?

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:58.590
Yup, Sone-sensei’s groupie.

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:00.840
Using flattery like that.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.780
She’s here, so I guess D-Class automatically wins!

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:07.170
Akie, are you jealous?

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:09.390
No, not at all! I’m just…

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:12.480
You’ve been Sone-sensei’s fan for a while.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:14.290
What? It’s different! Wait a second!

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:20.320
Anna-chan is so nice!

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:21.950
You like her too, Kira?

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:23.680
She’s a woman, you know.

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:25.780
Who cares?

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:31.440
Anna-chan’s pretty, cool, and mature… She attracts me!

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:34.490
I’m sorry.

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:39.540
Hey, you made a mistake, didn’t you?

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.520
I’m terriby sorry.

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:44.690
Don’t inconvenience my Anna-chan again.

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:48.200
Next time, I’ll choke you.

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:50.790
Yeah, got it.

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:55.200
What an idiot!

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:01.710
Ichimoku Ren, are you fine with this?

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:02.980
Hmm?

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:08.480
I mean, are you fine with a student cursing you?

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:10.600
What could I possibly do?

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:13.430
To go on a date with her to stop her hatred?

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:17.390
Not that, at least a nice word or two?

00:07:17.390 --> 00:07:18.200
I don’t want to.

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:19.800
Why?

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:22.630
If you’re nice to a woman, they just want to date you.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:28.410
Words, then phone calls, then dates. I don’t want any misunderstandings.

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:30.970
Quite a statement there.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.430
Aren’t I right?

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:37.870
Anyway, shouldn’t you at least see the face of the girl that liked you so much that she cursed you?

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:40.420
I’ll pass! Not interested.

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:42.210
Really!

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:48.930
What happened?

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:50.400
He saw her, apparently.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.260
Saw what?

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:55.030
The real reason he was cursed.

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:05.810
<i>Serizawa Yuuna, this girl, eh?</i>

00:08:10.770 --> 00:08:12.220
<i>Sensei!</i>

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:16.830
M-Me?

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:22.820
Bone Lady was loved, and Ichimoku Ren was a nuisance as a love rival.

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:27.860
She probably thinks you’re lovers, since you’re together so much.

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:32.330
Cut me some slack! Ichimoku Ren and I…

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:33.670
Sorry, Bone Lady.

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:34.390
Huh?

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:38.840
Becoming a rumor with an unpopular guy like me.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:46.210
Yamawaro.

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:48.940
Do me some good work!

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:51.900
I’ll try!

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:55.770
Now!

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:10.050
Ouch!

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:12.050
Are you OK?

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:14.550
Sone-sensei!

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:23.890
I’m sorry for making you take me home.

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:27.840
No, I’m sorry for making you get hurt.

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:30.900
But it isn’t even your fault!

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:33.760
Y-Yes, of course.

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:38.110
Do you always have them?

00:09:38.110 --> 00:09:38.660
What?

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:40.590
Bandages.

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:45.660
Yes, in case someone gets hurt in class.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.620
I didn’t know!

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:51.890
By the way, do you like any guys?

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:52.540
What?

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:58.180
I was just wondering what you young
 people’s love lives are like.

00:09:58.180 --> 00:09:59.860
I don’t.

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:00.680
Really?

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:04.850
I do like somebody, though.

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:07.820
Are you going to confess?

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:10.360
I can’t.

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:14.340
I’m ugly and depressed.

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:16.750
I don’t think so.

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:19.740
Also, that person already has a partner.

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:21.370
Really?

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:25.190
The partner has good looks, but is a narcissist.

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:30.360
He’s the type that girls normally like; I truly hate him!

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:33.900
<i>There’s a lot against Ichimoku Ren.</i>

00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:37.850
Maybe that’s not a partner?

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:43.600
That could be a total misunderstanding, like in dramas.

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:46.560
Maybe you should check?

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:47.910
Check?

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:49.690
Exactly.

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:55.090
No, I’m fine.

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:55.890
Eh?

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:58.510
I’m afraid of knowing the truth.

00:10:58.510 --> 00:10:59.700
Really?

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:03.450
Well, be careful!

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:04.670
W-Wait!

00:11:04.670 --> 00:11:05.440
What?

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:07.700
Was what you said just now true?

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:08.810
Just now?

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:12.710
That I wasn’t so bad.

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:15.210
Of course!

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:20.220
I think you could be more self-confident.

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:25.870
Thank you for today!

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:32.340
Your hair smelled good!

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:44.950
I thought she was a bad kid, but
turns out she’s pretty honest.

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:49.450
If it keeps up like this, she might grudge soon.

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.880
Heh, I got one!

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:36.920
You work hard, even ripping off the scab.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.940
“Sensei! I’m bleeding!” she said.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:42.230
Who cares?

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:45.320
Now I match with Anna-chan!

00:12:58.240 --> 00:13:00.120
What’s up, Kira?

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:02.680
No, nothing.

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:03.550
Huh?

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:11.550
What do you mean by a talk?

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:14.880
Did something happen to your neck?

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:19.950
No, I was bitten by a bug last night.

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:21.570
How about that bandage?

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:23.340
Oh, this? This…

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:24.320
What happened?!

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:28.310
I had it at home.

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:32.760
Oh, OK, got it.

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:36.680
I’ll be going now.

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:43.520
What?!

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:49.410
Just as I thought!

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:57.580
Don’t tell anybody!

00:13:57.580 --> 00:14:00.040
Morohoshi-san! Please!

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:16.520
Your grudge shall be released.

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:16.640
Your grudge shall be released.

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:17.100
Your grudge shall be released.

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:23.940
Your grudge shall be released.

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:23.280
Send

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:21.800
Serizawa Yunna

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:21.900
Serizawa Yuuna

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:22.600
Serizawa Yuuna

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:22.770
Serizawa Yuuna

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:23.940
Serizawa Yuuna

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:26.320
I’m here.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:32.690
I am Enma Ai.

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:36.240
Jigoku… Shoujo.

00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:38.080
Wanyuudou.

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:41.220
Sure thing, Ojou.

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:43.260
Take this.

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:50.730
If you really want to release your hatred, pull the red string.

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:56.790
If you pull it, it would mean you signed a formal contract with me.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:15:00.100
The one you hate will swiftly be sent to Hell.

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:07.370
But if you release your hatred, you have to pay the price.

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:10.870
Curse someone, and two holes are born.

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:15.730
If you agree to the contract, your soul will also fall to Hell.

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:18.070
Well, that’s after you die.

00:15:18.070 --> 00:15:18.640
But…

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:27.510
Forbidden from heaven, your soul will wander in pain and suffering.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:33.490
The rest is up to you.

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:53.670
What?

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:55.950
It’s not here!

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:57.670
Why?

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:05.250
Oops! I forgot to bring my sneakers!

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:06.950
You’re so stupid!

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:08.130
Go ahead!

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:11.760
Sheesh, where did they go?

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:23.010
Morohoshi

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:23.010
Morohoshi

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:23.010
W-What?

00:16:25.110 --> 00:16:26.940
Who did this?

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:27.730
Who is it?

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:33.230
What are <i>you</i> doing here?

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:36.310
Nothing, I just forgot something.

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:40.520
Lies! I know! You did this! Don’t mess with me!

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:44.250
Apologize! Quickly!

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:46.750
I’m… sorry…

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.860
So it was you!

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:49.660
But…

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:51.760
Trying to make excuses?

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:55.240
Sone-sensei… wanted to…

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:56.070
What?

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:04.770
Sensei said you were annoying, tagging along, that you were ugly.

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:06.980
That’s a lie!

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:12.380
No it isn’t, Sone-sensei tells me everything.

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:18.490
Because I’m her favorite student.

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:20.830
Well, I’m leaving.

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:43.460
A person like you should fall to Hell!

00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:47.040
Your grudge is received.

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:45.770
Welcome!

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:47.950
I haven’t seen you in a week!

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:49.770
Welcome to our time!

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:53.800
Today’s Juliet: Saigawara #4 Middle School PE teacher.

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:56.620
Sone Anna-san!

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:00.370
S-Sone-sensei!

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:00.370
Everyone!

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:02.880
Do you want Juliet’s love?

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:04.600
Yes!

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:06.220
Do you?

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:07.640
Yeah!

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:08.230
What?

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:12.600
Well then, competitors set your marks, get set…

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:29.430
Go! Waro-waro!

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:31.430
Hime, you’ll fall if you move around!

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:33.260
Go!

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:35.020
Even I!

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:38.260
Go! Go!

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:43.470
No! If it stays like this!

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:52.750
Thanks for the lead!

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:59.350
Next, if you want her love, Find the Daifuku Game!

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:00.440
Ready?

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:20.270
Help me! Waro-waro!

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:22.050
Yes, yes!

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:27.640
Wait! Cheater!

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:31.000
It’s the final match at last!

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:34.310
Which one will win her love?

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:37.850
I won’t lose, no matter what!

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:43.030
You’re in my way!

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:49.340
Fall to Hell!

00:20:58.170 --> 00:21:00.340
Yes! I win!

00:21:00.890 --> 00:21:02.840
I won your love!

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.630
Juliet!

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:08.830
What?

00:21:17.850 --> 00:21:20.390
O pitiful shadow, drowning in darkness.

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:23.740
Scarring people and looking them down.

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:27.790
The ball of karma drowns in sin…

00:21:30.380 --> 00:21:32.830
Want to die this once?

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:46.510
Why… Why did this happen to me?

00:21:46.510 --> 00:21:49.720
Curse someone, and two holes are born.

00:21:53.010 --> 00:21:57.690
Even though… I haven’t told you yet.

00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:05.740
This hate will send you to Hell.

00:22:05.740 --> 00:22:07.120
I’ll die!

00:22:12.220 --> 00:22:16.220
Hey, I found a cool guy!

00:22:16.220 --> 00:22:18.870
Again? You never take a rest.

00:22:18.870 --> 00:22:21.160
He’s a bit older, though.

00:22:21.160 --> 00:22:22.340
He’s plain.

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:23.800
The public servant.

00:22:24.210 --> 00:22:25.100
Usa-san!

00:22:30.930 --> 00:22:32.550
You don’t have to mind.

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:35.520
They’re OK with anybody.

00:22:36.900 --> 00:22:40.960
If they’re an adult that treats them specially.

00:22:44.490 --> 00:22:49.950
I will release your grudges.

00:22:44.490 --> 00:22:49.950
Note: Candle says, Morohoshi Kira.

