00:24:20.780 --> 00:24:22.270
Your name?

00:24:22.270 --> 00:24:23.420
Inuo Atsushi.

00:24:23.750 --> 00:24:26.070
Seems like you’re working hard.

00:24:26.440 --> 00:24:29.340
Mom has continued to be in pain.

00:24:29.340 --> 00:24:32.180
That’s why she acts like that.

00:24:32.180 --> 00:24:34.930
I can’t bother my mom.

